    "name": "github-agents-md-maintainer",
    "description": "Create an automation that keeps AGENTS.md current in one or more GitHub repositories. On a schedule - weekly by default - it clones the default branch, starts an OpenHands conversation that reads the repository and creates or updates AGENTS.md, and opens a pull request with the result.",
